quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>lavaan WARNING sample covariance\r\ncan not be inverted in group: 5</span></font></span></p><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">7: In lav_samplestats_from_data(lavdata = lavdata, missing =\r\nlavoptions$missing,<span>  </span>:</span></font></span></p><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>lavaan WARNING sample covariance\r\ncan not be inverted in group: 6</span></font></span></p><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">8: In lav_samplestats_from_data(lavdata = lavdata, missing =\r\nlavoptions$missing,<span>  </span>:</span></font></span></p><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>lavaan WARNING sample covariance\r\ncan not be inverted in group: 7</span></font></span></p><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">9: In lav_model_vcov(lavmodel = lavmodel, lavsamplestats =\r\nlavsamplestats,<span>  </span>:</span></font></span></p><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>lavaan WARNING: could not\r\ncompute standard errors!</span></font></span></p><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>lavaan NOTE: this may be a\r\nsymptom that the model is not identified.</span></font></span></p><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></font><br></div><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&gt; # 3) parameters</span></font></p><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&gt; modelp.ests &lt;- sem(modelp, data=data)</span></font></p><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">Warning message:</span></font></span></p><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">In vnames(FLAT, &quot;ov.x&quot;, warn = TRUE) :</span></font></span></p><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>lavaan WARNING: model syntax\r\ncontains variance/covariance/intercept formulas</span></font></span></p><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>involving (an) exogenous\r\nvariable(s): [x1 x2];</span></font></span></p><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>Please use fixed.x=FALSE or\r\nleave them alone</span></font></span></p><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></font><br></div><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">I don’t understand what it means. </span></font></p><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">I suppose the &quot;warnings&quot; are because some variables don’t vary\r\nwithin each group, but they do among groups. I don&#39;t know how to deal with this\r\nproblem, to include the two types of variables (those which vary only among\r\nsites &quot;intra site-invariant&quot; and those which vary among sites and also\r\nintra-sites) in the model analysis.</span></font></p><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">I am basically lost on how I have to apply this model. I will appreciate\r\nany help...</span></font></p><font size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">Thanking you in advance</span></font><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
